  "description": "A short romance fantasy story by Seomil.\n\nI am 9 years and 7 months old. And I am about to die.\n\nThe Future Grand Duke of the North, also known as the “Young Master”, is the person I wished to avoid the most. I've heard that he quickly eliminates people he doesn't like upon establishing eye contact with them... Is he going to kill me because I annoyed him right off the bat?!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \nTwitter, Naver Blog, Postype",
